   185	  `{"layers":[L],"profile":"tessera-v1-strict"}`, with the closed layer schema of section 15.1. ~~A required member
   186	  that is absent, at any nesting level, gives `UNVERIFIABLE / MEMBER_MISSING:<path>`; this rule precedes the generic
   187	  schema rule.~~ *(Withdrawn 2026-10-14, r2-F03: it contradicted the `object_format` and `issuer_record`
