   189	  required evidence member contributes UNVERIFIABLE/MEMBER_MISSING:<path>, except git.object_format, which
   190	  contributes GIT_OBJECT_FORMAT_MISSING. A present parent of the wrong type contributes CONTAINER_SCHEMA; do not
   191	  synthesize missing descendants beneath it. Absence of issuer_record is allowed; any defect in a present
   192	  issuer_record, including absent internal fields, contributes INVALID/CONTAINER_SCHEMA. Absence and schema failures
