   740	1. Recomputes the commit id from the presented raw commit object.
   741	2. Verifies `gpgsig` over the object without that header, under the pinned repository key.
   742	3. Follows commit, then tree, then blob, down the fixed path below.
   743	4. Checks that the stamped bytes name that id.
