  1717	| `algorithm` | decimal string | equals the RDATA algorithm; in {8, 13} |
  1718	| `dnskey_rdata` | base64 of RFC 4034 §2.2 RDATA | flags 257, REVOKE clear, protocol 3 |
  1719	| `ds_sha256` | 64 lowercase hex | SHA-256 over root owner wire `00` ‖ RDATA |
  1720	| `signing_start`, `signing_end` | RFC 3339; `signing_end` nullable | start ≤ end |
