    37	## In plain words
    38	
    39	This amendment has two parts.
    40	
    41	**Part 1** corrects six wording problems in Amendment 9. The owner decided these corrections. They add no
    42	mechanism. The verifier uses the same checks and gives the same verdicts. A review of the plain version of
    43	Amendment 9 found the six problems.
    44	
    45	Bitcoin is a public system that adds blocks to a chain. A block header states a chain time. This value is not a
    46	measurement of real time. The registered number k is six.
    47	
